  {
    "name": "story_heading",
    "label": "Introduction heading",
    "type": "text",
    "default": "Join Highwire for an exclusive in-person panel discussion on building trust and keeping critical energy projects moving forward."
  },
  {
    "name": "story",
    "label": "Introduction",
    "type": "richtext",
    "default": "<p>Across the country, solar farms are stalling, transmission lines are being rerouted and utility-scale projects are being shelved due to community misinformation.</p><p>As misinformation shapes how communities understand and respond to energy development, communications leaders have an increasingly important role to play.</p><p>Hear from leaders at Grid United, AES, and SHINE Technologies, moderated by Dave Roberts, host of Volts, as they share real strategies for preventing project delays, countering misinformation across fragmented platforms and using early community engagement to get ahead of reactive crisis response.</p>"
  },
